BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e903be4fa72e@paris-academique
DTSTAMP:20260527T165555Z
DTSTART:20260608T160000
DTEND:20260608T171500
SUMMARY:Conjugation in Affine Coxeter Groups and Beyond
DESCRIPTION:Conjugacy classes in rank n affine Coxeter groups have a beautiful and simple geometric description in terms of their natural action on (n-1)-dimensional vector spaces. Moreover\, one can locate the conjugating elements and centralizers in the vector space as well. These results allow to characterize the growth of the conjugator length function by geometric investigations.\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16445/
LOCATION:IHES
URL:https://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16445/
END:VEVENT
